## Domain Model

### Core Entities
| Entity | Package | Description |
|--------|---------|-------------|
| `User` | contracts/database | Parent user account |
| `Student` | contracts/database | Child linked to parent |
| `Alert` | contracts/database | Generated notifications (grade drop, missing assignment, etc.) |
| `Notification` | contracts/database | Delivery record (email, SMS, push, in-app) |
| `DeliveryResult` | contracts | Outcome of notification delivery |
| `Connector` | contracts/database | External data source connection (Canvas, Aeries, etc.) |
| `IngestRun` | contracts/database | Record of a data ingestion run |
| `Subscription` | database | Stripe billing subscription |
| `Payment` | database | Stripe payment record |
| `AuditLog` | database | Admin audit trail |
| `CommLog` | database | Communication delivery log |

### Alert Types
```typescript
enum AlertType {
  GRADE_DROP = 'grade_drop',
  MISSING_ASSIGNMENT = 'missing_assignment',
  ATTENDANCE_ISSUE = 'attendance_issue',
  PROGRESS_UPDATE = 'progress_update',
  UPCOMING_DUE = 'upcoming_due',
}
```

### Notification Channels
```typescript
enum NotificationChannel {
  EMAIL = 'email',
  SMS = 'sms',
  PUSH = 'push',
  IN_APP = 'in_app',
}
```

