## Project Patterns (MUST follow)
| Pattern | Implementation |
|---------|---------------|
| Services | `@scholaracle/agents` — NotificationService, generators, personalization |
| Repositories | `@scholaracle/database` — 15 repo classes (User, Student, Alert, etc.) |
| Delivery | `@scholaracle/agents/delivery` — Email, SMS, Push, InApp, DeliveryRouter |
| Contracts | `@scholaracle/contracts` — Alert, Notification, DeliveryResult, enums |
| Interfaces | `@scholaracle/interfaces` — INotification*, IAlert*, Reader/Writer |
| API Client | `packages/web/lib/api/` — typed clients per domain |
| Auth | `@scholaracle/auth` — JWT + TOTP/2FA |
| Validation | Zod + react-hook-form (frontend) |
| Styling | Tailwind 4 + shadcn/ui (Radix primitives) |

## Frontend Patterns

### Component Structure
```typescript
// ❌ REJECT — mixed concerns
export function Dashboard() {
  const [data, setData] = useState();
  useEffect(() => fetch('/api/...'), []);
}

// ✅ REQUIRE — hooks + composition
import { useAsyncData } from '@/lib/hooks/useAsyncData';
import { dashboardApi } from '@/lib/api/dashboard';

export function Dashboard() {
  const { data, loading, error } = useAsyncData(dashboardApi.get);
}
```

### Form Pattern
```typescript
// ✅ REQUIRE — react-hook-form + Zod
import { useForm } from 'react-hook-form';
import { zodResolver } from '@hookform/resolvers/zod';
import { studentSchema } from '@/schemas/student';

const form = useForm({ resolver: zodResolver(studentSchema) });
```

